  "draft_title": "各向同性软胶束易堆成多层，团队用氯化钾让它们在乳液界面铺展成单层。",
  "visual_prompt": "Create one 15 second 9:16 video with Omni Flash 1.2.\nOne continuous microscopic shot: tin deposits on mesoporous polydopamine coating remain dense and smooth during electroplating within a tin electrode surface in aqueous electrolyte.\nKeep the main subject in the upper-center and leave the lower third clean and uncluttered.\nNo visible text. No typography. No captions or subtitles. No title cards. No labels or annotations. No letters, words, numbers or symbols. No logos, watermarks or UI overlays. No pseudo-text or decorative glyphs. Do not display, transcribe, translate or paraphrase any text of any language.\nResolution: 720p. Output count: 1.\nGenerate the video once in a single pass. Do not extend, loop, resume or generate additional clips.\nInstrumental music only. Generate only a gentle instrumental background score, continuous through the video. No vocals, no singing, no lyrics, no human voice, no speech, no dialogue, no narration, no chanting, no sound effects, no ambience.",
